# ACCEPTANCE: cu-006

AC-1 ARCH.DOTENV.MERGE - a key present in .env but absent from the process environment resolves to the .env value.
AC-2 ARCH.DOTENV.MERGE - a key absent from both resolves to the conf/ file value.
AC-3 ARCH.DOTENV.MERGE - precedence is verified for String, Boolean and Long tiers.
AC-4 ARCH.DOTENV.EXPANSION - a .env value containing a reference arrives already expanded.
AC-5 EnvConfig exposes groupId, opencodeModel, opencodeTimeoutSeconds and the five object-store fields.
AC-6 ConfigFactory.load is no longer called; configuration comes from conf/ only.
AC-7 `sbt compile` and the precedence specification exit 0.
AC-8 The single-argument Env.load(cfg) overload still resolves for existing callers.
